OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Frather cloudy overnight with some
OL,7,Foccasional outbreaks of rain moving
OL,8,Facross the area. Staying windy at
OL,9,Ffirst, but beginning to ease later in
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA rather grey and damp start
OL,13,Fwith some further outbreaks of rain.
OL,14,FTurning drier into the afternoon with
OL,15,Fsome brightness developing. Winds
OL,16,Fcontinuing to ease but remaining
OL,17,Frather cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
