OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells on Friday and
OL,7,FSaturday. In the sunshine it will be
OL,8,Ffeeling increasingly warmer, before a
OL,9,Frisk of some rain returns by Sunday.
